 way, with clues and logic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSydney and villains are voice-acted to enhance engagement. Other characters are not, to encourage reading and imagination. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere is no profanity, blood/gore, sexual content...or even more damaging to young minds...lame dialogue and cheap endings!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOlder, wiser players will enjoy unconventional aphorisms that might cause them to reconsider their own philosophy. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHard-core RPG gamers should note that there is no inventory management or traits/abilities/skill point management. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor more information on Sydney's World for younger players, please visit the website.","developers":["Wise Dad Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362160/header.jpg?t=1612386319","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362160/50819/4a251eb6118dd7e726a33a7ff0a246ca951b684c/1751277534/dash_av1.mpd?t=1453516385","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362160/50819/4a251eb6118dd7e726a33a7ff0a246ca951b684c/1751277534/dash_h264.mpd?t=1453516385","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362160/50819/4a251eb6118dd7e726a33a7ff0a246ca951b684c/1751277534/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1453516385","id":256660075,"name":"Logo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256660075/movie.jpg?t=1453516385"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362160/49079/45a006f91c4640de19b0135736989fcaf1e579b6/1751277527/dash_av1.mpd?t=1451946854","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362160/49079/45a006f91c4640de19b0135736989fcaf1e579b6/1751277527/dash_h264.mpd?t=1451946854","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/362160/49079/4